{
  "title": "SQS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "생산자와 소비자를 분리하는 관리형 메시지 대기열이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#standard-queues\">Standard Queues</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#fifo-queues\">FIFO Queues</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\">Message Group ID and Deduplication ID</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">Visibility Timeout</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#receipt-handle-and-deletion\">Receipt Handle and Deletion</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#short-polling-and-long-polling\">Short Polling and Long Polling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#delay-queues-and-message-timers\">Delay Queues and Message Timers</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">Dead-letter Queues and Redrive</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#retention-and-large-payloads\">Retention and Large Payloads</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#encryption-policies-and-scaling\">Encryption, Policies and Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>51 / 62</span></div><h1>SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span>는 Producer와 Consumer 사이에 Message를 보관하는 관리형 Queue다. Producer가 작업을 넣고 Worker가 가져와 처리한 뒤 삭제하므로 두 시스템의 처리 속도와 장애를 분리할 수 있다.</p><p>ReceiveMessage는 영구 삭제가 아니다. Message는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">Visibility Timeout</a> 동안 다른 Consumer에게 숨겨지고, 처리 후 DeleteMessage가 성공해야 Queue에서 제거된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"처리 성공과 실패\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>처리 성공과 실패</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Success</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>ReceiveMessage</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">Visibility Timeout</a> 시작</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Worker processes task</strong><small>결과를 안전하게 저장</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>DeleteMessage</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#receipt-handle-and-deletion\">Receipt Handle</a>로 삭제</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Failure</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>ReceiveMessage</strong><small>Message가 잠시 숨겨짐</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Worker fails</strong><small>삭제하지 못함</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Visible again / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a></strong><small>Timeout 후 재시도·반복 실패 분리</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">다시 보이는 Message가 반드시 Queue의 맨 뒤로 이동한다고 보장하지 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"standard-queues\"><h2>Standard Queues<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#standard-queues\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>높은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>, At-least-once Delivery와 Best-effort Ordering을 제공한다. 같은 Message가 다시 전달될 수 있으므로 Consumer를 Idempotent하게 만든다. 엄격한 순서를 요구하는 Workflow에는 FIFO <span class=\"full-name\">(First In, First Out)</span>를 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fifo-queues\"><h2>FIFO <span class=\"full-name\">(First In, First Out)</span> Queues<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#fifo-queues\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Message Group 안에서 순서를 유지하고 Deduplication 기능을 제공한다. Group 간에는 병렬 처리가 가능하다. Consumer가 처리 후 삭제 전에 실패하는 상황까지 외부 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>의 Exactly-once Side Effect가 자동 보장되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\"><h2>Message Group ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span> and Deduplication ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\">Message Group ID</a>는 순서·동시 처리 범위를 결정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#message-group-id-and-deduplication-id\">Deduplication ID</a> 또는 Content-based Deduplication은 지원 시간 창의 중복 Send를 제어한다. 모든 Message에 같은 Group ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>를 쓰면 병렬 처리 범위가 좁아진다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"visibility-timeout\"><h2>Visibility Timeout<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Receive 뒤 일정 시간 Message를 다른 Worker에게 보이지 않게 한다. Worker 실패·삭제 누락 시 Timeout 이후 다시 처리될 수 있으며 항상 Queue 맨 뒤로 이동한다고 보장하지 않는다. 긴 작업은 ChangeMessageVisibility로 시간을 조정한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"receipt-handle-and-deletion\"><h2>Receipt Handle and Deletion<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#receipt-handle-and-deletion\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Receive 때 받은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#receipt-handle-and-deletion\">Receipt Handle</a>을 사용해 Message를 삭제한다. Message ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#receipt-handle-and-deletion\">Receipt Handle</a>은 역할이 다르다. 작업 완료·결과 저장 전에 삭제하면 Worker 장애 때 작업을 잃을 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"short-polling-and-long-polling\"><h2>Short Polling and Long Polling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#short-polling-and-long-polling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#short-polling-and-long-polling\">Short Polling</a>은 즉시 응답하며 빈 응답이 생길 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#short-polling-and-long-polling\">Long Polling</a>은 Message 도착을 기다려 빈 요청과 비용을 줄인다. Poll 대기 시간과 Client HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Timeout을 맞춘다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"delay-queues-and-message-timers\"><h2>Delay Queues and Message Timers<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#delay-queues-and-message-timers\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Delay는 처음 전달되기 전 대기이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">Visibility Timeout</a>은 Receive 후 숨김이다. Queue 수준 Delay와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#delay-queues-and-message-timers\">Message Timer</a>의 지원 차이를 확인한다. 긴 일정·반복 Schedule은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/#eventbridge-scheduler\">EventBridge Scheduler</a>와 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\"><h2>Dead-letter Queues and Redrive<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>반복 실패 Message를 maxReceiveCount 조건으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>로 옮겨 분석한다. 원인을 고친 뒤 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">Redrive</a>로 재처리할 수 있다. FIFO <span class=\"full-name\">(First In, First Out)</span>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>로 분리하면 전체 Business Sequence에 영향이 있을 수 있어 순서 요구를 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"retention-and-large-payloads\"><h2>Retention and Large Payloads<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#retention-and-large-payloads\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Retention이 지나면 처리되지 않은 Message도 삭제된다. Payload 제한을 넘는 큰 데이터는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 저장하고 참조를 Message로 보내는 Pattern을 고려한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object 보존·삭제 시점과 Queue 재시도 기간을 맞춘다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption-policies-and-scaling\"><h2>Encryption, Policies and Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#encryption-policies-and-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>SSE와 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>, Queue Policy·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Endpoint Policy</a>로 접근을 제어한다. Queue Backlog와 처리 시간에 따라 Worker를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>할 수 있다. Worker 수만 늘려도 Downstream DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 한도가 병목이면 전체 처리량이 늘지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>영상 변환 요청을 SQS <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Queue Service)</span>에 넣고 Worker가 완료 결과를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 저장한 뒤 Message를 삭제한다. 작업 ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>로 중복 결과를 방지하고 반복 실패는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>에서 조사한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>가져왔다는 사실만으로 메시지가 영구 삭제되지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSSimpleQueueService/latest/SQSDeveloperGuide/welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q071\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q072\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q091\" data-question=\"Q091\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q091</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q091/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO SQS settings help recover from temporary message-processing failures?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q091\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Copy an AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q091\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A dead-letter queue for repeated failures</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q091\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An appropriate visibility timeout</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q091\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Delete messages immediately on receipt</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q091\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address on a network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · 처리 시간에 맞게 숨김 시간을 두고 반복 실패는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>로 격리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">이전 용어 <b>SNS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">다음 용어 <b>Step Functions</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
